  "prefLabel": "Env-C 211.02 Definition",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 211.02 Definition.\n\n(a) “Installation” means the treatment facility, device, appliance, or installation that is the subject of the application.\n\nSource. #8851-B, eff 3-25-07; ss by #10802-B, eff 3-24-15",
